{"id":911912,"title":"07｜CodeAct模式：实现加和计算器","content":"本节课主要介绍了CodeAct模式的理论与代码实践。CodeAct模式基于ReAct模式演变而来，通过简化ReAct模式的五个阶段为三个阶段：大模型分析问题并生成代码、人类执行代码并将结果返回给大模型。在理论部分，详细解释了CodeAct模式如何让大模型自动生成Python代码并在本地执行，最终返回结果或继续生成代码。代码实践环节使用LangGraph框架搭建工作流，定义了中央状态存储器和多个节点，包括大模型调用节点、条件判断节点和代码执行节点，形成循环直至得到最终答案。示例中，大模型生成了一个简单的累加代码，计算1到100的和，最终输出5050。课程总结强调了CodeAct模式的核心在于简化ReAct模式，使其更适用于实际应用场景，并鼓励学生通过课后作业进一步理解和应用该模式。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402674,"user_name":"张申傲","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1182372,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"22D46BC529BA8A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/0a/a4/828a431f.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1759046544,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146366,"content":"是的 这节课主要是为大家介绍基本的框架 套路","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1759057391,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":402674,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"为了保证系统安全和数据隔离，执行代码最好还是在SandBox中进行，如E2B或Docker","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":672108,"discussion_content":"是的 这节课主要是为大家介绍基本的框架 套路","content_length":62,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1759057391,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":402710,"user_name":"药师","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1213258,"ip_address":"山西","ucode":"14BB054A38A2F0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/ava